# Rendered output is rebuilt from source. The reference deck
# carousels/2026-10-content-model/ keeps its out/ in git. Do not ignore that folder.
*/out/
!2026-10-content-model/out/

# Spec-kit working decks (carousels/_work/<slug>/). Ignored in full except this folder's README:
# spec.json, caption.md, img/, and the render. A render produces out/, numbered PNGs,
# carousel.pdf, preview.png and a generated deck.html. None of those are committed.
# This does not match the tracked reference deck carousels/2026-10-content-model/.
/_work/*
!/_work/README.md
/_work/**/out/
/_work/**/*.png
/_work/**/*.pdf
/_work/**/preview.png
/_work/**/deck.html
